SEC. 51P-1016.111. OPEN SPACE.

(a) Minimum open space is 15 percent of the entire Property.

(b) No more than 50 percent of the required open space area may be provided in detention areas.

(c) Open space areas must contain a combination of a minimum of four of the following pedestrian amenities:

(1) fountains;

(2) benches;

(3) trash receptacles;

(4) bicycle racks;

(5) pedestrian paths;

(6) pedestrian scaled lighting; or

(7) shade structures. (Ord. 31226)
